		<p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
		<h1>Get in touch</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Corrections, guide questions, and partnership notes welcome. Sourcing asks for AAS, SARMs,
			peptides, or grey gear get a hard no — see <a href="/about">About</a> and the
			<a href="/blog/ped-harm-reduction-australia">PED guide</a> for how we talk about culture.
		</p>

		<p>
			Email stub until the domain inbox is live:
			<a href="mailto:hello@yehbro.com">hello@yehbro.com</a>
		</p>

		<ul>
			<li>Content corrections → include the page URL</li>
			<li>Disclosure questions → link the page</li>
			<li>Brand partnerships → legal sports nutrition / wellness only</li>
		</ul>

		<p><a href="/start-here">Start here</a> · <a href="/disclosure">Disclosure</a></p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
